  "content": "\n\n<h4><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1306/488/banner-png.png\"></strong></h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><strong>⚠注意：自 2026 年 1 月 8 日起，Heycronus 團隊的所有專案將僅透過 CurseForge、Modrinth 和 Planet Minecraft 上的 devHeycronus 帳號進行官方發布與維護。</strong></h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><strong>更好的附魔桌</strong>為 Minecraft 的附魔系統增添更多活力與細節。此材質包為<strong>書架</strong>與<strong>附魔桌</strong>賦予了精美的<strong>3D 設計</strong>，讓您的圖書館與附魔室看起來</h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;呈現前所未有的沉浸感。<br>為了強化魔法氛圍，<strong>附魔桌浮現的文字現在變為彩色</strong>，每次進行附魔時都能營造出充滿活力與神秘感的氛圍。</h4>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dLAEZJ6TS7CYP6%2526no_recurring%253d0%2526item_name%253dHelp%2bme%2bcontinue%2bwith%2bthe%2bprojects%2bwith%2ba%2bsimple%2bdonation%2b-%2bHeycronus%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1013293/description_41c410a1-3705-48e1-9d6d-faca354f3234.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"93\"></a></p>\n<h4>✨ 特色：</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>具備真實深度的 3D 書架</li>\n<li>3D 附魔桌模型</li>\n<li>彩色浮現文字增添魔法氣息</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1306/491/support-png.png\"></p>",
